    "text": "The induced emf in the circular loop <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>PQ</mi></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Bav</mi></math><br /><br />Therefore electrical power consumed by the circular loop<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>emf</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>Bav</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/WhatsApp_Image_2020-06-20_at_3.30.18_PM.jpeg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 185px;\" />",
